# Binaries
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
/dist/
/bin/

# Where "GoForms: Build..." puts the desktop binary, the WebAssembly bundle
# and the packaged .apk. All three are hundreds of megabytes and all three
# are reproducible from this source, so none of them belong here.
/build/
*.apk
*.wasm

# Test artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Go workspace files: they point at sibling checkouts, which are a property of
# one machine's layout, not of this repository.
go.work
go.work.sum

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
